+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project's version numbering scheme is Semantic Versioning (semver). The project previously used calendar versioning (calver), but the recorded decision moved it to semver; the decision's configuration file was later relocated out of the source tree, but no subsequent decision has changed or revoked the semver choice, so it remains the current recorded scheme.
